<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Roche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernesy) Ltd has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Roche Holding, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10,750.00 SFR	   PREMIUM	14.30 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     15.60 SFR		 GEARING	13.20 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 05.DEC.96-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	04.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
